summary:
Redis uses RESP (REdis Serialization Protocol), a text-based protocol. RESP3 (Redis 6+) adds new types. Types: Simple String (+...
), Error (-...
), Integer (:...
), Bulk String ($len
 data 
), Array (*count
 ...), Null (_
), Boolean (#t/f
), Double (,...
), Big Number (,...
), Bulk Error (!len
 ...), Verbatim String (=len
 fmt:...), Map (%count
), Set (~count
), Attribute (|count
), Push (>count
).

